1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,860
搞什么鬼
What the hell?

2
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:04,240
我的天 他把媽的舊車也拖來了
Oh, my God. He brought Mom's old car?

3
00:00:04,338 --> 00:00:05,908
要知道 那玩意再適合迪迪不過了
You know, that thing was perfect for Dede --

4
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,600
又吵 又偏左
loud, pulled way to the left,

5
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:09,220
還總在公共場合抽風
and constantly broke down in public.

6
00:00:10,247 --> 00:00:12,717
我前妻迪迪兩個月前去世了
My ex-wife, Dede, died two months ago,

7
00:00:12,817 --> 00:00:15,197
她丈夫杰瑞把她想留給我們的破爛
and her husband, Jerry, drove down with a bunch of junk

8
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:16,260
都拉了過來
she wanted us to have.

9
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:17,640
我一直很喜歡杰瑞
I always liked Jerry.

10
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,260
那你為什么總用奇怪的眼神看他
Then why did you always look at him funny?

11
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,800
因為我知道他所面臨的悲慘命運
Because I knew what he was in for.

12
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:24,080
我看人們登上泰坦尼克號的錄像時
Same way I look at the footage of those people

13
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:25,120
也是那種眼神
boarding the Titanic.

14
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:28,020
杰 這是給你的
Jay, this is for you.

15
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:29,180
老天爺 那是她的灰嗎
Oh, God. Is that her?

16
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:31,100
不不不 這是你們度蜜月時
No, no, no. Apparently this is a jar of sand

17
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,540
從邁阿密海灘帶回的沙子
from your honeymoon in Miami Beach.

18
00:00:32,637 --> 00:00:34,597
是啊 當時我們住在楓丹白露酒店
Oh, yeah. We stayed at the Fontainebleau.

19
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:36,880
猜猜我們在電梯里遇到了誰
Guess who we took an elevator with?

20
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:37,880
杰基·格利森[演員]
Jackie Gleason.

21
00:00:38,127 --> 00:00:39,407
我告訴他我們才在《蜜月期》
I told him we were the honeymooners,

22
00:00:39,407 --> 00:00:42,007
他開玩笑威脅道要把迪迪揍到月亮上去
and, as a joke, he threatened to punch Dede to the moon.

23
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:43,460
笑點在哪
Why is that funny?

24
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:45,000
我就是這個意思 哪里好笑
Well, that's my point. It wasn't right.

25
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:47,960
克萊爾 你媽想把她的舊跑車留給你
Claire, your mom wanted you to have her old sports car.

26
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:49,160
太好了
Oh, great.

27
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:52,700
米奇爾 她的珠寶給你
And Mitchell, you get to keep her jewelry.

28
00:00:52,957 --> 00:00:54,097
這么說克萊爾得到了跑車
Oh, so Claire gets a car,

29
00:00:54,097 --> 00:00:56,137
而我得到了一盒子綠松石
and I get a, uh, box of turquoise.

30
00:00:56,137 --> 00:00:57,087
你想交換嗎
Want to trade?

31
00:00:57,087 --> 00:00:57,967
不 這樣挺好的
No. No, it's fine.

32
00:00:57,967 --> 00:00:59,407
我家有個"不到十三歲的少女"
I have a preteen girl at home,

33
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:00,460
"她"喜歡玩扮裝游戲
and she likes to play dress-up.

34
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:02,160
再說 莉莉或許也會喜歡
And, you know, Lily might like it, too.

35
00:01:02,237 --> 00:01:04,887
米奇爾 克萊爾 迪迪想讓你倆決定
Mitchell and Claire, Dede wanted you two to decide

36
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:06,040
誰把她帶回家
who gets to keep her.

37
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:08,140
抱歉 杰 她沒把你包括在內
Sorry, Jay. She left you out of this one.

38
00:01:08,217 --> 00:01:10,187
別擔心 杰瑞 我有沙子就夠了
No worries, Jerr. I'm good with the sand.

39
00:01:10,187 --> 00:01:13,047
等等 你說"把她帶回家"是什么意思
Hang on. Uh, what do you mean, "Gets to keep her"?

40
00:01:13,627 --> 00:01:14,728
那就是迪迪
That's Dede.

41
00:01:14,917 --> 00:01:17,557
我們把她的骨灰和根垛有機融合在一起了
We had her ashes organically fused with the root ball.

42
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:18,940
太像老媽的風格了
That is so Mom.

43
00:01:18,947 --> 00:01:22,117
是啊 最后還要留樣東西讓我們爭
I know. Setting up one last thing for us to fight over,

44
00:01:22,117 --> 00:01:23,116
因為我們誰都不想要那棵樹
because neither of us want that tree.

45
00:01:23,116 --> 00:01:24,276
因為我們都想要那棵樹
Because both of us want the tree.

46
00:01:24,276 --> 00:01:25,097
什么
What?

47
00:01:25,106 --> 00:01:26,107
輕松解決
That was easy.

48
00:01:40,126 --> 00:01:41,257
酷
Oh, cool.

49
00:01:41,446 --> 00:01:43,886
看 外婆把她家的舊玩具箱留給我們了
Look. Nana left us her old toy box from her house.

50
00:01:43,886 --> 00:01:46,216
保佑她那顆有囤積癥的心
Aww, bless her hoarding heart.

51
00:01:46,216 --> 00:01:47,916
還記得我過去總躲在這里
Remember how I used to hide in here

52
00:01:47,916 --> 00:01:50,236
像嚇人的怪物一樣跳出來嗎
and pop out like a scary monster?

53
00:01:50,676 --> 00:01:52,536
那時我還有那么多潛能
I had so much promise back then.

54
00:01:54,966 --> 00:01:56,756
能震動的棍馬
A stick horse that vibrates?

55
00:01:56,966 --> 00:01:58,006
我一直搞不懂用意
I never got the point.

56
00:01:58,006 --> 00:01:58,786
我說不好
I don't know,

57
00:01:58,786 --> 00:02:01,686
但我記得過去一"騎"就是好久
but I remember spending hours riding on it.

58
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:02,380
我也是
Same.

59
00:02:04,836 --> 00:02:06,806
快看這個 艾麗克斯
Oh. Lookie here, Alex.

60
00:02:06,806 --> 00:02:08,986
你最大屈辱的根源
The source of your greatest shame --

61
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:11,860
我能解開但你解不開的積木拼圖
the puzzle that I solved but you never did.

62
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:13,320
誰在乎
Who cares?

63
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:14,780
當時我們都是蠢小孩
We were just dumb kids.

64
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:15,860
不
Uh, no.

65
00:02:16,180 --> 00:02:17,700
我們才是蠢小孩
We were dumb kids,

66
00:02:17,700 --> 00:02:19,340
而你是小天才
and you were the genius.

67
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:21,040
那肯定讓你寢食難安吧
That must eat away at you.

68
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:21,900
拜托
Please.

69
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:24,560
我是名牌大學的尖子生
I'm top of my class at a prestigious university,

70
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:26,840
我和別人共同發明了一種
and I co-invented a technology

71
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:28,940
應用于天體物理學和醫學的技術
that has applications to astrophysics and medicine.

72
00:02:28,940 --> 00:02:30,620
把那該死的積木拼圖給我
And give me that damn puzzle!

73
00:02:31,540 --> 00:02:33,340
我的天 是露露
Oh, my God, it's Lulu!

74
00:02:33,900 --> 00:02:35,780
她曾是我最喜歡的玩具
She was my favorite toy.

75
00:02:42,825 --> 00:02:45,455
我猜我只是很想念外婆
I guess I-I just really miss Nana.

76
00:02:45,500 --> 00:02:46,660
我還懷孕了
Also I'm pregnant.

77
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:48,460
迪蘭和我還沒告訴任何人
Dylan and I haven't told anyone

78
00:02:48,460 --> 00:02:50,440
因為我還在努力接受這個事實
because I'm still trying to get my head around it,

79
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:53,800
可抱著露露讓一切變得那么真實
but holding Lulu made it so real.

80
00:02:55,140 --> 00:02:57,820
我就要有一個活生生的寶寶了
I'm gonna have an actual baby.

81
00:02:58,855 --> 00:03:00,015
我壓力好大
Aah, I'm so stressed!

82
00:03:00,015 --> 00:03:00,955
我真希望現在還是五十年代
I wish it was the '50s

83
00:03:00,955 --> 00:03:02,485
那時人們還認為懷孕時喝酒抽煙
when it was still healthy to drink and smoke

84
00:03:02,500 --> 00:03:04,160
不會不健康
when you're pregnant.

85
00:03:06,980 --> 00:03:09,260
我等不及翻新這臺寶貝了
I cannot wait to restore this baby.

86
00:03:09,320 --> 00:03:10,800
高中時欺負我的惡霸就有一臺
My high school bully had one.

87
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:13,380
你肯定想不到這車能跑多快
You'd be surprised how fast this thing can go.

88
00:03:13,695 --> 00:03:16,175
能輕松追上騎著單車
No problem catching up with a kid on a bike

89
00:03:16,175 --> 00:03:18,175
提前十分鐘離校的孩子
who left school 10 minutes early.

90
00:03:18,175 --> 00:03:19,325
我不確定我希望車庫里
I don't know if I want another

91
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:21,360
又多一件慢慢生銹的半成品
half-finished project rusting away in the garage.

92
00:03:21,695 --> 00:03:23,725
我放棄機器割草機的唯一原因
The only reason I stopped working on robot lawnmower

93
00:03:23,725 --> 00:03:25,635
是因為它開始變得太聰明了
was 'cause he started getting too smart.

94
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:27,900
別這樣 親愛的 我們留著吧
Come on, honey. Let's keep it.

95
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:30,740
它讓我想起我媽能有多瘋狂
It reminds me of how crazy my mom could be.

96
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:33,260
什么樣的老媽會有這樣的車
I mean, what mother has a car like this?

97
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:35,660
這樣如何 我們開出去兜一圈
How's this? We take it for one drive.

98
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:37,780
假如回來時你臉上沒有笑容
If you're not smiling by the time we come back,

99
00:03:37,780 --> 00:03:38,680
我們就不要了
we get rid of it.

100
00:03:40,105 --> 00:03:41,035
-只兜一圈 -只兜一圈
- One drive? - One drive.

101
00:03:41,035 --> 00:03:42,235
-只兜一圈 -只兜一圈
- One drive. - One drive.

102
00:03:42,235 --> 00:03:44,745
她過去總把我和米奇爾
Ugh, she used to double-buckle me and Mitchell

103
00:03:44,745 --> 00:03:45,835
一起綁在副駕
into the front seat.

104
00:03:45,835 --> 00:03:47,845
再加上她自制的電熱毯
Between that and the homemade electric blankets,

105
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:49,400
我倆還活著簡直是奇跡
it's a wonder we're still alive.

106
00:03:52,140 --> 00:03:53,020
怎么請了水管工
What's with the plumber?

107
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:55,060
喬又把海王玩具沖下馬桶了嗎
Did Joe flush his Aquaman down the toilet again?

108
00:03:55,300 --> 00:03:57,200
不 我那些親戚離開時
No. When my cousins left,

109
00:03:57,200 --> 00:04:00,380
告訴我客房沒有熱水
they said that the hot water in the guest bedroom was not working.

110
00:04:00,420 --> 00:04:02,300
水管工剛才說一切正常
The plumber just said that there's nothing wrong.

111
00:04:03,160 --> 00:04:05,020
是有人把熱水關了
Someone turned it off.

112
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:05,820
八成是喬
Probably Joe.

113
00:04:06,340 --> 00:04:07,320
我們要怎么罰他
So, what are we thinking?

114
00:04:07,340 --> 00:04:08,240
一周不準約小朋友來家玩
No play dates for a week?

115
00:04:08,320 --> 00:04:09,760
我知道是你關的
I know it was you.

116
00:04:09,864 --> 00:04:12,494
你想讓他們走 就把他們凍走了
You wanted them gone, and you froze them out.

117
00:04:12,500 --> 00:04:13,960
我不承認有做過
I'm admitting nothing,

118
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:17,240
但你說你的一個親戚會來這里住一天
but you said one cousin would be here for one day,

119
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:18,600
結果三個人在這里住了一周
and there were three here for a week.

120
00:04:18,620 --> 00:04:19,920
我才沒說過
I never said that.

121
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,920
為什么杰瑞還在這
Why is Jerry still here?

122
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:24,820
是啊 肯定出什么事了
I know. Something must be wrong.

123
00:04:25,340 --> 00:04:28,460
他像個受傷的小老頭一樣坐在車里
He's sitting in the car like a sad little man.

124
00:04:28,540 --> 00:04:30,200
我們得讓他進來坐坐
We have to go and invite him in.

125
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:32,080
別 別 別 他總會走的
No, no, no, no. He'll move off eventually.

126
00:04:32,224 --> 00:04:34,854
歌洛... 周四的街道清掃會掃走他的
Glor-- Street sweeping is Thursday.

127
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:38,320
杰瑞 你還好嗎
Jerry, is everything okay?

128
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,940
你的車需要人幫忙推一把嗎
Yeah, does your truck need a push?

129
00:04:40,264 --> 00:04:41,585
這就是最該死的地方
It's the darnedest thing.

130
00:04:41,820 --> 00:04:43,180
我好像開不走了
I can't seem to drive away.

131
00:04:43,704 --> 00:04:46,424
放下迪迪的東西是要做的最后一件事
Dropping off Dede's stuff was the last check on the ol' list.

132
00:04:46,644 --> 00:04:48,224
我現在很迷茫[迷路]
Heck if I'm now feeling pretty lost.

133
00:04:48,224 --> 00:04:50,744
我懂 你沿這條街往前開
Yeah, I get it. Listen, you just drive down this street,

134
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:52,260
右轉 就到高速路了
turn right, and you'll hit the freeway.

135
00:04:52,460 --> 00:04:54,000
杰瑞 進來坐坐吧
Jerry, just come inside.

136
00:04:54,300 --> 00:04:55,180
不了 我不用了
No, I couldn't.

137
00:04:55,334 --> 00:04:56,654
對 要愛戴有尊嚴的男人
Yeah, got to love a man with pride.

138
00:04:56,700 --> 00:04:58,620
愛和自豪送你快樂上高速
That's the thing that'll serve you well on the freeway.

139
00:04:58,960 --> 00:05:01,300
進來吧 我給你做點吃的
Just come inside, I'll make you something to eat,

140
00:05:01,300 --> 00:05:02,840
你想待多久就待多久
and you can stay as long as you want.

141
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:03,440
是吧 杰
Right, Jay?

142
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,140
總有一天 歌洛莉亞
One of these days, Gloria.

143
00:05:05,340 --> 00:05:06,720
總有一天干嘛
One of these days what?

144
00:05:06,740 --> 00:05:07,880
沒什么 我就隨口一說
Nothing. Just one of these days.

145
00:05:09,620 --> 00:05:11,860
好了 我們把媽媽放在哪里好呢
All right. Where should we put Mom?

146
00:05:12,003 --> 00:05:13,393
不能離窗戶太近
Uh, not too close to the window.

147
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:14,940
不想以后二十年為了不讓她聽到小聲說話
Don't want to spend the next 20 years whispering.

148
00:05:14,940 --> 00:05:17,340
好 這么說 你媽可以是棵樹
Okay, so, your mom can be a tree,

149
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:18,540
但是我跟你說我的叔叔霍納斯
but when I told you my Uncle Honus

150
00:05:18,540 --> 00:05:20,400
跌進打谷機 結果來年春天
fell into a thresher and the next spring,

151
00:05:20,653 --> 00:05:22,273
一只長得和他一模一樣貓頭鷹帶著他的
an owl appered with his exact face

152
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:24,020
懷表出現的時候 你嗤之以鼻
and pocket watch, you poo-pooed it.

153
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,440
你為什么非要為難我
Why are you being so difficult?

154
00:05:25,740 --> 00:05:27,080
因為我們最初在一起的時候
Because when we first got together,

155
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:29,580
你答應我有一天我們會搬回
you promised that someday we would move back

156
00:05:29,580 --> 00:05:31,660
我們家的農場 但是每一年
to my family farm, and every year,

157
00:05:31,660 --> 00:05:33,500
這所謂的終有一天都被拋在腦后
the someday gets kicked further down the road

158
00:05:33,543 --> 00:05:34,603
像愛管閑事的人口普查員被嫌棄一樣
like a nosy census taker.

159
00:05:34,603 --> 00:05:37,333
而且 一旦你把你媽種在這里
And -- And once you plant your mom here,

160
00:05:37,333 --> 00:05:38,313
我們就永遠別想走了
we're never gonna leave.

161
00:05:38,340 --> 00:05:39,200
這么說有點過
That's crazy.

162
00:05:39,223 --> 00:05:40,853
而且我 我覺得你應該不想
And I-I-I don't think you want to talk

163
00:05:40,980 --> 00:05:42,600
跟我扯到我們以前做過的承諾吧
about promises we made back then.

164
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,600
你什么意思
What are you suggesting?

165
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:45,920
-我說到的都做到了 -真的嗎
- I've kept every promise I've made. - Really?

166
00:05:46,220 --> 00:05:49,060
你答應過在我余生的每個月送我一枝玫瑰
You promised me a rose a month for the rest of my life,

167
00:05:49,083 --> 00:05:51,353
所以我估計這么算我已經死了十五年了
so I guess I dropped dead 15 years ago.

168
00:05:51,353 --> 00:05:53,173
我讀了一篇文章說這樣對環境...
I read an article that said it was environmentally ins--

169
00:05:53,173 --> 00:05:54,843
我就沒見你看過書
I've never seen you read an article.

170
00:05:55,500 --> 00:05:57,660
還有 你說你一定會看《E.T》
Also, you said you'd finally watch "E.T.",

171
00:05:57,660 --> 00:05:59,000
我有史以來的最愛電影
my all-time favorite movie.

172
00:05:59,043 --> 00:06:00,773
那個電影太蠢了
Oh, it just seems so stupid.

173
00:06:00,953 --> 00:06:02,023
有什么好看的
What am I caring about?

174
00:06:02,023 --> 00:06:03,623
一個皺巴巴的木偶
A wrinkly puppet with a Christmas light

175
00:06:03,740 --> 00:06:04,980
嚇人的指尖還長著圣誕彩燈
at the end of his creepy finger?

176
00:06:04,980 --> 00:06:07,180
真要這么比嗎 我說我會看
And really? Me saying I would watch

177
00:06:07,180 --> 00:06:08,840
什么感人熱淚電影和你答應我有一天
some pandering sap-fest is the same

178
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:12,260
我能和家人重聚能一樣嗎
as you saying I would someday be reunited with my family?

179
00:06:12,260 --> 00:06:13,620
承諾就是承諾
A promise is a promise.

180
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:15,340
太同意了
I couldn't agree more.

181
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:18,200
簡直不能更同意
I couldn't agree more.

182
00:06:20,840 --> 00:06:24,640
所以 你基本沒錯過多少好戲
So, anyway, you haven't missed much around here.

183
00:06:27,960 --> 00:06:29,460
抱歉給你們添麻煩
I'm sorry to be such a burden.

184
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:32,120
我不知道怎么從這件事走出來
It's just I don't know how to move on.

185
00:06:32,220 --> 00:06:34,200
我一直在拼命燒香
I've been going through incense like crazy.

186
00:06:34,262 --> 00:06:35,612
可憐人
Oh, poor man.

187
00:06:35,612 --> 00:06:37,042
來 吃點東西
Here. Eat something.

188
00:06:37,100 --> 00:06:39,700
我知道你吃素 所以我做了番茄湯
I know you're a vegetarian, so I made you tomato soup.

189
00:06:40,402 --> 00:06:42,512
看起來很好吃 有沒有給我剩一點
That looks pretty good. You have any left over for me?

190
00:06:42,512 --> 00:06:43,632
我扔了
Aw, I threw it out.

191
00:06:43,860 --> 00:06:46,840
我知道你不喜歡任何東西待太久
I know that you don't like things staying around too long.

192
00:06:48,340 --> 00:06:49,600
她在生我的氣
She's mad at me.

193
00:06:49,980 --> 00:06:51,880
她的親戚待得太久了 我不歡迎他們
Her family overstayed their welcome,

194
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:53,560
就把熱水停了
and I turned off the hot water,

195
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:54,820
還把房間里的燈泡卸了幾個
took a few bulbs out of the room.

196
00:06:54,820 --> 00:06:55,980
你懂的 婚后生活
You know how it is when you're married.

197
00:06:56,242 --> 00:06:58,082
迪迪和我從沒拌過嘴
Dede and I never had a cross word.

198
00:06:58,082 --> 00:06:59,023
真的假的
What?

199
00:06:59,052 --> 00:07:00,572
那不可能
That is not possible.

200
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:02,020
是真的 如果氣氛開始緊張
Yep. If things ever got heated,

201
00:07:02,100 --> 00:07:03,780
我就走到她身后
I'd come up behind her,

202
00:07:03,780 --> 00:07:04,980
把我的手纏繞到她脖子上
put my hands on her neck...

203
00:07:05,060 --> 00:07:06,080
這想法我也有過
I'm with you so far.

204
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:08,260
然后給她按摩 跟她說她是對的
...then massage her and tell her she was right.

205
00:07:08,260 --> 00:07:10,180
但是如果是她的錯呢
But what if she wasn't right?

206
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:12,180
那只是自尊心作祟
That's ego talking.

207
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:15,140
在佛教里 我們相信戰勝自己
In Buddhism, we believe it's better to conquer yourself

208
00:07:15,140 --> 00:07:16,440
要比贏一千場戰役好得多
than win a thousand battles.

209
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:18,940
怪不得尼泊爾每次奧運都"大獲全勝"
That's why Nepal is always crushing it at the Olympics.

210
00:07:19,300 --> 00:07:21,080
杰 明智的男人會走過去
Jay, an enlightened man would go over there

211
00:07:21,080 --> 00:07:23,420
說" 歌洛莉亞 我愛你并且尊重你"
and say, "Gloria, I love and respect you,

212
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:25,240
所以毋庸置疑我也愛你的家人且尊重他們
so of course I love and respect your family.

213
00:07:25,400 --> 00:07:26,720
對不起"
I am sorry."

214
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:28,060
但是都是她的錯
But it was all her fault.

215
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:30,200
她不愿意承認 但是她跟我說的就是
She wouldn't admit it, but she told me

216
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:32,860
一個親戚來這待一天
one person was staying with us for one day.

217
00:07:33,140 --> 00:07:36,180
這是她的原話[短信] 但是她言下之意是什么
That's her text, but what was her subtext?

218
00:07:37,340 --> 00:07:38,600
杰瑞 你真是個天才
Jerry, you're a genius.

219
00:07:39,140 --> 00:07:40,500
她給我發過短信
She sent me a text.

220
00:07:40,940 --> 00:07:42,020
我有證據
I have the proof.

221
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:42,680
歌洛莉亞
Gloria?

222
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,540
-干嘛 -看這里
- What? - Right here.

223
00:07:45,200 --> 00:07:46,960
你不用走過來
You don't have to walk over here.

224
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:49,240
你字體那么大我從房間那頭都能看見
I can read your giant font from across the room.

225
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:51,500
"杰 回家之后不要報警
"Jay, don't call the police when you come home.

226
00:07:51,540 --> 00:07:52,300
家里的是我親戚
It's my cousin.

227
00:07:52,500 --> 00:07:54,720
他要跟我們住一天"
He's staying with us for one day."

228
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:56,340
我看看
Let me see.

229
00:08:05,220 --> 00:08:07,860
再跟我捋一遍那個佛教的胡說八道
Walk me through that Buddhist nonsense again.

230
00:08:09,691 --> 00:08:12,441
有意思吧 享受著耳邊風吹和清新空氣
Fun, huh? Feel that wind and smell that air.

231
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:13,860
是啊 這車太顛簸了
Yeah, it's so bumpy.

232
00:08:14,221 --> 00:08:16,531
那是運動化懸掛系統 我和路之間毫無阻礙
Sports suspension. Nothing between me and the road

233
00:08:16,531 --> 00:08:18,121
除了我的露關節手套
except my knuckle-less gloves.

234
00:08:18,140 --> 00:08:19,580
你為什么會有這玩意
Why do you even have those?

235
00:08:19,601 --> 00:08:20,601
這是鄧菲家族的怪癖
Oh, a quirk of the Dunphys.

236
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:22,480
我的手指怕冷 但我的指關節怕熱
My fingers get cold, but my knuckles get hot.

237
00:08:23,200 --> 00:08:24,000
快看啊
Check it out!

238
00:08:24,601 --> 00:08:26,171
有能放八首歌的音響 我超喜歡的
There's an 8-track player. I love it.

239
00:08:26,171 --> 00:08:27,461
我們來聽歌吧
Let's crank something.

240
00:08:27,751 --> 00:08:30,321
沒聽說過這支樂隊 "磁頭清潔帶"
Never heard of this band -- Head Cleaner.

241
00:08:30,460 --> 00:08:33,280
里面有什么我們就聽什么吧
Yeah, why don't we just listen to whatever's in there?

242
00:08:34,191 --> 00:08:35,611
老天啊
Oh, my God.

243
00:08:35,611 --> 00:08:38,281
-這首歌讓我回到了從前 -是啊 我好愛
- Oh, this takes me back. - Yeah, I love it.

244
00:08:38,961 --> 00:08:40,811
* 發動汽車 *
* Get your motor goin' *

245
00:08:42,061 --> 00:08:44,841
* 朝門口馳騁而去 *
* Heading for the doorway *

246
00:08:45,241 --> 00:08:47,651
* 烹煮一場冒險 *
* Cooking an adventure *

247
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:50,380
* 然后朝門口馳騁而去 *
* And then we make that doorway *

248
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:51,560
好好玩
So fun!

249
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:53,860
你笑了 你喜歡這輛車
You're smiling. You love the car.

250
00:08:54,181 --> 00:08:55,711
我剛想起件事
Ah, I just remembered something.

251
00:08:55,711 --> 00:08:56,561
什么事 告訴我
What? Tell me.

252
00:08:56,561 --> 00:08:58,361
是我高中時的事
It's a -- It's a thing from high school.

253
00:08:58,500 --> 00:09:00,380
快說嘛 大路上沒有秘密
Come on. There are no secrets on the open road.

254
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:03,420
我剛想起我在這輛車上破的處
I just remembered that I lost my virginity in this car.

255
00:09:03,880 --> 00:09:04,640
你說什么來著
What's that now?

256
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:07,660
我男朋友晚上偷偷把車開出來
Yeah, my boyfriend snuck the car out at night

257
00:09:07,660 --> 00:09:08,460
然后 你懂的
and then, you know...

258
00:09:08,700 --> 00:09:09,760
*他找到了"門口"*
* He found the doorway *

259
00:09:12,580 --> 00:09:14,340
我的指關節熱到不行了
Oh, my knuckles are overheating.

260
00:09:14,340 --> 00:09:15,660
你很在意這件事 是嗎 菲爾
This isn't bothering you, is it, Phil?

261
00:09:15,660 --> 00:09:17,100
你也告訴過我你的第一次啊
I mean, you told me about your first time.

262
00:09:17,100 --> 00:09:19,260
我是為了解釋我為何討厭蜜蜂才說的
I told you about that to explain why I hate bees so much.

263
00:09:19,260 --> 00:09:20,600
我們別再討論這事了
Let's just not talk about this anymore.

264
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:21,120
好吧
Okay.

265
00:09:21,740 --> 00:09:25,570
* 天生狂野 *
* Born to be wild *

266
00:09:25,570 --> 00:09:27,500
當時播的就是這首歌 對吧
This is the song that was playing, isn't it?

267
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:28,741
是其中一首
It's one of them.

268
00:09:31,500 --> 00:09:32,840
我去做午飯 你們要吃嗎
I'm gonna fix lunch. Want some?

269
00:09:33,140 --> 00:09:34,180
你居然要吃午飯
You're eating lunch?

270
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:36,140
是不是有什么我不知道的新網絡挑戰
Is there some new Internet challenge I'm not aware of?

271
00:09:36,140 --> 00:09:37,840
還有 你的娃娃為什么綁了繃帶
And why is your doll in bandages?

272
00:09:38,180 --> 00:09:40,800
你知道我的 我小時候就很愛玩醫生游戲
You know me. I always loved playing doctor.

273
00:09:41,090 --> 00:09:43,020
其實我不小心開車碾過她
The truth is, I accidentally ran her over

274
00:09:43,020 --> 00:09:44,830
把她胳膊扯斷了 本來也沒什么
and ripped her arm off, which might have been fine

275
00:09:44,830 --> 00:09:48,630
但可惜那并不是我今日唯一一次要害死嬰兒
if that was the only baby-mangling issue I had today.

276
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:52,960
天啊
Oh, my God!

277
00:09:53,460 --> 00:09:55,320
天啊
Oh, my God.

278
00:09:57,520 --> 00:09:59,030
我不是當媽的料
I'm not cut out to be a mother.

279
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:02,120
但話說回頭 真正的嬰兒比娃娃好照顧 對吧
Then again, a real baby is easier than a doll, right?

280
00:10:02,540 --> 00:10:05,300
真正的嬰兒著火了
Like, a real baby would let you know

281
00:10:05,300 --> 00:10:07,200
會讓大人知道
if it was on fire.

282
00:10:08,680 --> 00:10:10,520
老天 你為什么在哭
Oh, God, why are you crying?

283
00:10:10,520 --> 00:10:13,340
你是不是剛贏下最古怪的選美比賽
Did you just win the weirdest beauty pageant ever?

284
00:10:14,020 --> 00:10:16,300
我遵守承諾了 米奇爾 180個月的玫瑰
Promises kept, Mitchell -- 180 months of roses,

285
00:10:16,300 --> 00:10:19,520
以及我剛看了男孩和外星人之間的
and I just watched the most beautiful love story

286
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:20,880
最美好的愛情故事
between boy and alien.

287
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:24,380
世人為何就不能擁有孩童般的心呢
Why can't the world have the hearts of children?

288
00:10:26,399 --> 00:10:27,799
我想最令我感動的部分是
You know, I think the thing that touched me the most

289
00:10:27,799 --> 00:10:31,689
我們全力支持ET找到
was how we were really rooting for E.T. to find

290
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:32,840
回家的路
his way home.

291
00:10:32,989 --> 00:10:34,139
你不小心發現"回家"這個巧合
I bet you were pretty thrilled

292
00:10:34,139 --> 00:10:35,619
一定很激動吧
to stumble upon that coincidence.

293
00:10:35,619 --> 00:10:36,409
我是不討厭啦
I didn't hate it.

294
00:10:36,409 --> 00:10:39,399
總之 我的承諾都兌現了
Anyway, I'm all caught up in the promises department.

295
00:10:39,399 --> 00:10:40,249
輪到你了
Your serve.

296
00:10:40,249 --> 00:10:42,099
小卡 我剛開始到地檢署上班
Cam, I just started at the D.A.'s office.

297
00:10:42,099 --> 00:10:44,269
短期內不能搬家
I -- I can't move anytime soon.

298
00:10:44,300 --> 00:10:45,560
再說 莉莉上學怎么辦
Plus, what about Lily's school?

299
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:47,300
我老家也有學校啊
They have schools in Grasshopper.

300
00:10:47,420 --> 00:10:47,900
真的有嗎
Do they?

301
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:50,920
-再說 莉莉在這里有很多朋友 -真的有嗎
- Plus, Lily has so many friends here. - Does she?

302
00:10:51,500 --> 00:10:52,700
你們在講我嗎
Did I hear my name?

303
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:55,160
你們倆八婆在瞎聊什么呢
What are you two yentas gabbing about?

304
00:10:55,299 --> 00:10:56,349
我們剛在討論
We were just talking about

305
00:10:56,349 --> 00:10:57,989
搬去爺爺奶奶的農場
moving to Grandma and Grandpa's farm

306
00:10:57,989 --> 00:11:00,139
就在龍卷風多發地區的中心
in -- in the heart of Tornado Alley.

307
00:11:00,139 --> 00:11:03,189
天啊 小卡 你看 她都嚇壞了
Oh, God. Cam -- Cam. Look, she's clearly terrified.

308
00:11:03,189 --> 00:11:04,249
好吧 別擔心 親愛的
Yeah, well, don't worry, sweetie,

309
00:11:04,249 --> 00:11:05,549
因為這事已經定下了
because it's already been determined.

310
00:11:05,549 --> 00:11:07,069
我們這輩子都留在這里
We're staying here forever,

311
00:11:07,069 --> 00:11:11,569
因為另一個爸爸要把去世的奶奶種到后院里
because other daddy is planting dead Nana in the backyard.

312
00:11:11,569 --> 00:11:12,159
我不玩了
I'm out.

313
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:14,040
讓其中一個孩子接收她的骨灰
Okay, it was my mother's last wish

314
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:16,220
是我媽媽的遺愿 而克萊爾不想要她
that one of us take her, and Claire doesn't want her.

315
00:11:16,220 --> 00:11:17,120
你想讓我怎么做
What do you want me to do?

316
00:11:17,259 --> 00:11:18,119
那你想讓我怎么做
Well, what do you want me to do?

317
00:11:18,119 --> 00:11:20,429
那個農場已經在我家族百年了
The farm has been in my family for 100 years.

318
00:11:20,509 --> 00:11:22,439
下一個繼承人是我 你也知道我爸的
You know, I'm next in line, and you know Daddy.

319
00:11:22,439 --> 00:11:23,859
他身體大不如前了
H-He's slowing down.

320
00:11:23,880 --> 00:11:25,740
你媽剛給我們發了他贏得
Your mother just sent us a video of him

321
00:11:25,740 --> 00:11:27,100
水上踩滾木比賽的視頻
winning a log-rolling contest.

322
00:11:27,680 --> 00:11:30,380
他參加的是老年組 而且第二天他累壞了
Only in his age group, and he was so spent the next day,

323
00:11:30,380 --> 00:11:31,740
公雞第一次打鳴他都沒醒來
he slept through his first rooster crow

324
00:11:31,740 --> 00:11:33,600
叫賴床的打鳴他也沒醒
and his snooze rooster crow.

325
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:35,300
你就承認吧 你根本沒打算
Just admit it -- you have no intention

326
00:11:35,300 --> 00:11:36,920
遵守承諾 搬去密蘇里州
of keeping your promise of moving to Missouri.

327
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:38,240
其實 你說得對
You know what? You're right.

328
00:11:38,348 --> 00:11:41,658
我永遠無法想象自己住在那個農場里 抱歉
I -- I can't ever imagine myself living on that farm. I'm sorry.

329
00:11:41,740 --> 00:11:43,560
你說出來了
Well, there it is.

330
00:11:44,278 --> 00:11:46,848
我真慶幸ET不是降落在你家里
I'm just glad E.T. didn't land at your house.

331
00:11:48,400 --> 00:11:49,940
別用那種眼神看我
Okay, don't give me that look.

332
00:11:50,168 --> 00:11:51,178
你以后會回密蘇里州的
You'll get to go back to Missouri

333
00:11:51,178 --> 00:11:54,298
等你媽從監... 公主營回來
when your mom gets released from pris-- uh, princess camp.

334
00:11:54,298 --> 00:11:56,538
你口香糖嚼得很兇嘛 是不是
You're really hitting the gum pretty hard, aren't you?

335
00:11:56,538 --> 00:11:59,038
我該怎么做 就這么壓下去嗎
How do I do this? Do I -- Do I just push down?

336
00:11:59,120 --> 00:11:59,700
我不知道啊
I don't know.

337
00:12:00,660 --> 00:12:01,040
不行
Nope.

338
00:12:02,958 --> 00:12:04,118
我一開始不太順利
I got off to a slow start,

339
00:12:04,118 --> 00:12:05,848
