Careful. That's my wife you're talking to.

515
00:18:43,643 --> 00:18:45,653
抱歉 杰瑞 好啦
Oh, sorry, Jerr, yeah. Okay.

516
00:18:45,653 --> 00:18:47,823
我希望你能夠成長為一棵健壯大樹
I hope you grow up into a nice, big tree,

517
00:18:47,823 --> 00:18:50,193
也希望你不會染上蟲害
a-and I hope you don't get any of those beetles

518
00:18:50,193 --> 00:18:51,283
會弄死植物的那種
that are killing everything.

519
00:18:51,320 --> 00:18:53,200
等以后你在這落地生根了
And when you settle in in a little while,

520
00:18:53,260 --> 00:18:55,760
或許我會帶喬來爬你
maybe I'll bring Joe over and he can climb you.

521
00:18:56,723 --> 00:18:57,624
阿門
Mm. Amen.

522
00:18:58,380 --> 00:18:58,960
你說完了嗎
You done?

523
00:18:59,720 --> 00:19:00,660
應該吧
Yeah, I think so.

524
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:02,160
不介意我說兩句吧
Mind if I say a word?

525
00:19:02,340 --> 00:19:03,380
把她交給你了
She's all yours.

526
00:19:04,520 --> 00:19:05,380
杰是個大氣男人
Jay was a big man.

527
00:19:06,200 --> 00:19:07,460
他跟他的老婆道歉了
He apologized to his wife.

528
00:19:08,220 --> 00:19:09,500
你知道她怎么做了嗎
And do you know what she did?

529
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:11,820
她也道歉回去了
She apologized back!

530
00:19:12,580 --> 00:19:14,560
你有跟我道歉過一次嗎
Did you ever do that even once?!

531
00:19:14,560 --> 00:19:16,400
我跟你道歉過上千次吧
I apologized to you a thousand times,

532
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:18,600
而你只讓我自己憋著火
and you let me just eat it.

533
00:19:18,782 --> 00:19:20,252
我受夠跟你說你永遠都是對的了
Well, I'm tired of telling you you're always right,

534
00:19:20,252 --> 00:19:21,472
因為你猜怎么著
'cause guess what?

535
00:19:21,580 --> 00:19:23,740
那只海豚壓根就認不得你
That dolphin did not recognize you.

536
00:19:24,140 --> 00:19:25,560
你的俳句有太多音節了
Your haikus had too many syllables.

537
00:19:25,860 --> 00:19:28,280
還有相信我 素食者也需要用止汗除臭劑
And trust me, vegans do need deodorant!

538
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:30,560
好啦 走吧
All right. Come on.

539
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:32,740
來吧 小家伙 讓哥請你吃上好牛排
Come on, kid. Let me buy you a nice steak.

540
00:19:33,060 --> 00:19:33,480
好
Yeah.

541
00:19:34,640 --> 00:19:35,600
來 給
Hey. Here.

542
00:19:35,872 --> 00:19:37,542
我想你吃點東西
I-I want you to eat something.

543
00:19:37,622 --> 00:19:38,422
小心
Be careful.

544
00:19:38,422 --> 00:19:40,542
謝謝你對我這么無微不至
Thank you for taking such good care of me,

545
00:19:40,542 --> 00:19:41,482
哪怕你心里不高興
even when you're mad.

546
00:19:41,482 --> 00:19:43,702
沒 天啊 我沒有不高興
No. My gosh, I am not mad.

547
00:19:43,702 --> 00:19:45,052
我也不該逼你的
And I shouldn't have pushed.

548
00:19:45,052 --> 00:19:48,372
對不起 但如果我們今天學到一件事
I-I'm sorry, but, you know, if we learn one thing today,

549
00:19:48,372 --> 00:19:51,472
那就是你不可能在農村里活下來
it's that you couldn't survive on a farm.

550
00:19:51,472 --> 00:19:52,653
我會沒事的
I'll be fine,

551
00:19:52,940 --> 00:19:54,900
-因為我會有你的陪伴 -什么
- because I'll be with you. - What?

552
00:19:55,462 --> 00:19:58,332
我想... 當我用你的角度看這事
I guess w-when I look at things from your point of view,

553
00:19:58,412 --> 00:20:00,152
我的確做出了承諾
I -- I made a promise.

554
00:20:00,800 --> 00:20:02,800
如果你爸爸真的需要你接手一切
When your dad needs you to take over the farm,

555
00:20:03,200 --> 00:20:04,100
我愿意加入
I'm in.

556
00:20:04,840 --> 00:20:06,640
米奇爾 你這話對我意義重大
Mitchell, that means so much to me,

557
00:20:06,640 --> 00:20:08,680
你也會喜歡那一切的
and you're gonna love it.

558
00:20:08,680 --> 00:20:10,720
清新空氣 也沒有惱人車潮
The fresh air, and there's no traffic.

559
00:20:10,720 --> 00:20:12,420
等鎮上有你這第二個律師
Oh, and with a second lawyer in town,

560
00:20:12,440 --> 00:20:13,720
我們就能重開法院了
we could reopen the courthouse.

561
00:20:14,442 --> 00:20:16,142
你給羊擠過奶嗎
H-Have you ever milked a goat?

562
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:18,320
你有試過從牛奶罐直接喝剛擠的牛奶嗎
Have you ever had fresh milk right from the spigot?

563
00:20:18,640 --> 00:20:19,580
好喝到不行
Oh, unbelievable.

564
00:20:19,832 --> 00:20:21,772
但你也得小心蛇蟲鼠蟻
You do have to be careful of snakes and mice and rats.

565
00:20:21,800 --> 00:20:23,560
那里有巨多田鼠
There's a ton of field mice.

566
00:20:23,880 --> 00:20:26,500
我很怕 小時候有一只沿著我的袖子爬上來了
They scare me. One ran up my sleeve one time when I was a kid.

567
00:20:28,440 --> 00:20:31,420
這車比我印象中小 可能我沒那么靈活了
This car is smaller than I remember. I think I'm just less flexible?

568
00:20:31,660 --> 00:20:33,080
我大腿好像抽筋了
I think I threw out my lap.

569
00:20:34,251 --> 00:20:36,511
我們剛才... 只是在清理車庫
We were um... just cleaning out the garage.

570
00:20:36,720 --> 00:20:37,860
少來 我們全聽到了
Nice try, we heard everything.

571
00:20:37,891 --> 00:20:39,241
不過在快"結束"的時候
Although around the finish line,

572
00:20:39,241 --> 00:20:41,401
我們有點不確定哪個聲音是誰了
we kind of lose track of who's who.

573
00:20:41,401 --> 00:20:44,861
真不敢相信媽又抓到你在車上做愛
I can't believe Mom caught you having sex in the car again.

574
00:20:44,861 --> 00:20:46,641
你叫那棵樹媽嗎
You are calling the tree Mom?

575
00:20:46,760 --> 00:20:47,220
行吧
Okay.

576
00:20:47,531 --> 00:20:49,011
聽我說 在經過一番討論后
So listen, after some reflextion,

577
00:20:49,011 --> 00:20:51,311
我們覺得她在你這里會比較好
we decided that she might be be off here.

578
00:20:51,311 --> 00:20:52,461
在你拒絕之前...
Before you say no.

579
00:20:52,461 --> 00:20:54,031
我也想要這樣
I would actually like that.

580
00:20:54,341 --> 00:20:57,221
車庫里的叫聲是怎么回事
Hey! What was those screeching in the garage?

581
00:20:57,280 --> 00:20:58,240
浣熊又回來了嘛
Are the raccoons back?

582
00:20:58,500 --> 00:20:59,180
靠
Damn it!
